    <statement><p>Calculate the 3x3 determinant:</p>
<p><m>\left| \begin{array}{ccc}
-5 \amp  0 \amp  6 \\
-6 \amp  -8 \amp  -5 \\
-6 \amp  6 \amp  2  \end{array} \right| =</m> <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>-574</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><m>\left| \begin{array}{ccc}
-5 \amp  0 \amp  6 \\
-6 \amp  -8 \amp  -5 \\
-6 \amp  6 \amp  2  \end{array} \right| = -5 \left| \begin{array}{ccc}
 -8 \amp  -5 \\
 6 \amp  2  \end{array} \right| - 0  \left| \begin{array}{ccc}
 -6 \amp  -5 \\
 -6 \amp  2  \end{array} \right| + 6  \left| \begin{array}{ccc}
 -6 \amp  -8 \\
 -6 \amp  6  \end{array} \right| =</m>



<m>= -5(-8\cdot 2 + 5\cdot 6)-0(-6\cdot 2 + 5\cdot -6)+6(-6\cdot 6 + 8\cdot -6)=-574</m>






</solution>
